    "detailed_description": "<h1>SNOWRIFTERS</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>SNOWRIFTERS VEHICLE EXHIBITION</strong><br><br>This is a Virtual Vehicle Exhibition in a museum like environment where you can teleport around and look at the models. <br>A Showcase Room for the vehicles, some props and weapons from the race game Snowrifters. <br>Get an impression of the unique design from Timon Sager. <br>Snowrifters is currently in development. This is a little teaser, to see how the vehicle will look in game. <br><br>Thank you for your time.",
